## Your Car Might Be a Monterey Lemon If…

- The manufacturer has made at least two attempts to repair a major warranty-covered problem.

- Your car has been in the shop for thirty or more cumulative days.

- The defects were not caused by misuse, neglect, or unauthorized alterations.

